1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,780
Speaking, task two. Card number 1. You are at the post office. You want to send a parcel abroad. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:13,700
You are at the post office. You want to send a parcel abroad.

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,395
Hello. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,352
Hello, I want to send a parcel to Ukraine. How much does it cost?

5
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:30,000
A parcel up to 5 kilograms costs 650 CZK.

6
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,550
How long does it take?

7
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:38,525
The parcel will be there in about five days.

8
00:00:43,733 --> 00:00:45,354
Can I pay by card?

9
00:00:45,567 --> 00:00:48,260
Yes, you can pay by card or in cash.

10
00:00:53,467 --> 00:00:55,200
Can I track the parcel online?

11
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,956
Yes, you will find the tracking number on the receipt.

12
00:00:58,167 --> 00:01:01,167
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:01:01,367 --> 00:01:03,133
You're welcome. Goodbye.

14
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:12,265
Practise card 1 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
